{"id":"n52139-2-2","stage":2,"title":"또한 · 并且","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n52139-2-2-1","ko":"물건값이 정말 싸네요.","zh":"这个东西的价格真的好便宜啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"물건값이","meaning":"商品，物品；价格，价钱","explanation":"물건：商品，物品；값：价格，价钱；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"물건","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3"},{"term":"값","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66247","senseId":"4","lemma":"물건","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"},{"entryId":"20178","senseId":"1","lemma":"값","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"정말","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"싸네요.","meaning":"便宜，贱","explanation":"싸다：便宜，贱；네요：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，礼貌句末。","readings":[{"term":"싸다","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29718","senseId":"1","lemma":"싸다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df279371093362d8","term":"물건","zh":"商品，物品","audio":"/audio/df279371093362d858f6.mp3","entryId":"66247","definition":"买卖的东西。","pronunciation":["물건"]},{"id":"b19ddf94b4c9896b","term":"값","zh":"价格，价钱","audio":"/audio/b19ddf94b4c9896bb5c6.mp3","entryId":"20178","definition":"给买卖的东西划定的货币数量。","pronunciation":["갑"]},{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"b291179e0fe019b6","term":"싸다","zh":"便宜，贱","audio":"/audio/b291179e0fe019b65663.mp3","entryId":"29718","definition":"价格低于一般价位。","pronunciation":["싸다"]}],"audio":"/audio/73ac4074829d8c3df20c.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n52139-2-2-2","ko":"또한 품질도 좋습니다.","zh":"而且质量也很不错。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"또한","meaning":"并且，而且","explanation":"또한：并且，而且","readings":[{"term":"또한","audio":"/audio/4bbb0e61c121fb97ab61.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"52139","senseId":"2","lemma":"또한","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"품질도","meaning":"品质，质量","explanation":"품질：品质，质量；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"품질","audio":"/audio/ce22e94483cb4fbf1920.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88645","senseId":"1","lemma":"품질","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋습니다.","meaning":"好，美，优良，优美","explanation":"좋다：好，美，优良，优美；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"1","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"4bbb0e61c121fb97","term":"또한","zh":"并且，而且","audio":"/audio/4bbb0e61c121fb97ab61.mp3","entryId":"52139","definition":"除此之外还有。","pronunciation":["또한"]},{"id":"ce22e94483cb4fbf","term":"품질","zh":"品质，质量","audio":"/audio/ce22e94483cb4fbf1920.mp3","entryId":"88645","definition":"物品的性质和质地。","pronunciation":["품ː질"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"好，美，优良，优美","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"性质或内容等很优秀，让人满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/0f058758888683192754.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":1.554,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=52139","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":62,"sequenceScore":1.3807,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["而且质量也很不错。","这个东西的价格真的好便宜啊。","那边走的男孩是谁？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个东西的价格真的好便宜啊。","那边走的男孩是谁？","而且质量也很不错。"],"answer":2}]}
